## Third-party components

This package does **not** bundle or redistribute any proxy kernel.

It downloads **mihomo** (https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo) at the user's
request, at runtime, into the user's own `$DSH_HOME` directory. mihomo is
licensed separately under the **GNU General Public License v3.0**, and remains
governed by that license as an independent program. It is not a derivative work
of this package and is not distributed with it.

The GeoIP/GeoSite data files (`country.mmdb`, `geosite.dat`) are likewise
downloaded at runtime from https://github.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat and
remain under their own terms.
